{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> has the property that for each real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in its domain, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d172d3d8333a9c1740b123ea13d5b44f22446869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" /> is also in its domain and \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edc79d79703691ce01f38e47e5cccfe30d173a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>What is the largest set of real numbers that can be in the domain of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7beb8d12fa38c46ce55bec9431d4f16049b9356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } \\{x|x\\ne 0\\}\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } \\{x|x&lt;0\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"252\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/9/8e944c7ed51c8eda299eb8d6dc48966c2c94ea20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C) \\ } \\{x|x&gt;0\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/0/1000edba6af8b1601dc6ad929ce424b14c4063db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\ } \\{x|x\\ne -1\\;\\rm{and}\\; x\\ne 0\\;\\rm{and}\\; x\\ne 1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"292\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/0/89091ba652dcccdb288832dbd8a33423cb9d2206.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E) \\ }  \\{-1,1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Quickly verifying by plugging in values verifies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are in the domain.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edc79d79703691ce01f38e47e5cccfe30d173a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)+f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a0901419c277658469226431138dfb5ede474b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"37\" /> into the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a>: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d024a98c21d62bd8800c55d0427adc0a08e42d3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)+f\\left(\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{x}}\\right)=\\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"169\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/9/0c99e2f37a419f18bbafe08b121cf60499370bf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)+ f(x)= \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"149\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f047f1d60a202045343859e4327e55eaaa20482f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + f\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"108\" height=\"43\" /> cannot have two values: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/064fd95c7f6eb31fb2912713ac171020ffe26541.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/835a72a392da3bdadab0dbcc275dee5242bc7c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/f/60f897977fafd5029aa2100cafb1020d67922730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the largest <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a> that can be in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Domain\" title=\"Domain\">domain</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/c/c8c4b9203525ec6a393bc36feabceff0f3ccfb84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-1,1\\} \\Rightarrow E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/546685e9f8741e90d52e53fafe86aeb1f79328a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) + f \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) = x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"150\" height=\"43\" /> Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/064fd95c7f6eb31fb2912713ac171020ffe26541.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"47\" height=\"37\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/7719eaa8dde229d3b29828b6b5045ea6194488a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + f \\left(\\frac{1}{\\frac{1}{x}}\\right) = \\frac{1}{x}\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"45\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c45495e2dce6fe7f6e9a0558605d11e88a9c10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + f(x) = \\frac{1}{x}.\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Also notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6c78e7baaf12360805502ec97ade5f739e32cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f \\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right) + f(x) = x\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"43\" /> by the commutative property(this is the same as the equation given in the problem. We are just rearranging). So we can set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a564fb7d4622b2e8c5b71ed477d635f6379fa0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"48\" height=\"37\" /> which gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f424f1753ba66a66c48a233c5afe322d41467a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> which is answer option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/2/202e30ddc1b6129261aecbfe53c3007f111df7d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(E) \\ }  \\{-1,1\\}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"105\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">2006 AMC 12A Problems</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017034732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 245/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5635/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.536      1 -total\n 59.48%    7.457      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 38.82%    4.867      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2355:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017034732 and revision id 133822. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}